{"id":"a530300b50678fce","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-p-poly-advice.md","title":"多项式建议与P/poly等价","display":"thm-p-poly-advice — 多项式建议与P/poly等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-p-poly-advice","aliases":["28-thm-p-poly-advice"],"display":"thm-p-poly-advice — 多项式建议与P/poly等价","depends_on":["[[28-df-time-advice-class]]","[[28-df-p-poly]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 6.18 and proof","source_printed_pages":"113","source_pdf_pages":"139","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-p-poly-advice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-p-poly-advice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-p-poly-advice — 多项式建议与P/poly等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"070fdf0798352e03\" href=\"?note=070fdf0798352e03\" title=\"28-df-time-advice-class\">28-df-time-advice-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 6.18 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"113"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"139"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ADTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{ADTIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"070fdf0798352e03\" href=\"?note=070fdf0798352e03\" title=\"28-df-time-advice-class\">28-df-time-advice-class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{P/poly}\">\\(\\mathbf{P/poly}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{P/poly}=\\bigcup_{a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{ADTIME}\\left(n\\mapsto c(n+2)^{a+b+1},\\ n\\mapsto(n+2)^b\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{P/poly}=\\bigcup_{a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{ADTIME}\\left(n\\mapsto c(n+2)^{a+b+1},\\ n\\mapsto(n+2)^b\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>电路族作为逐长度建议串，固定算法对其描述求值，给出从左到右的模拟；建议长度可补零至单项式长度。反向展开固定多项式时间建议机在长度n及建议长度(n+2)^b上的计算为多项式电路，再把建议输入硬连线。无界扇入多项式规模电路先变为有界扇入，规模仍多项式。本次比对书中这两向证明，但未逐格复核TM到电路的统一构造，故仅登记陈述核验。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 6.18 and proof；印刷 pp.113 / PDF pp.139。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-time-advice-class","status":"resolved","id":"070fdf0798352e03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-time-advice-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p-poly","status":"resolved","id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p-poly]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-advice-class","status":"resolved","id":"070fdf0798352e03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ADTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-time-advice-class]]，$\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 见 [[28-df-p-poly]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p-poly","status":"resolved","id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ADTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-time-advice-class]]，$\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 见 [[28-df-p-poly]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ADTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{P/poly}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{P/poly}=\\bigcup_{a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{ADTIME}\\left(n\\mapsto c(n+2)^{a+b+1},\\ n\\mapsto(n+2)^b\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1589,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]、[[28-df-time-advice-class]]、[[28-thm-p-poly-advice]]、[[28-thm-p-uniform-characterization]]、[[28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy]]、[[28-df-circuit-eval]]。"}],"outgoing":["070fdf0798352e03","bdb0c5ef1940ab80"]}